## 常用命令

### 编译 / 排版

```bash
# 博士论文:Quarto ccnu-thesis
cd manuscripts/博士论文/
quarto render

# 课程备课:Quarto 范式
cd chapters/
quarto render

# 期刊/学生论文:视具体配置
cd manuscripts/{title}/
quarto render
```

### 检索 / 知识库

```bash
# 记忆搜索
openclaw memory search "{关键词}"

# Wiki 搜索
wiki_search "{query}"

# 全文检索(项目内)
grep -rn "{关键词}" ~/.openclaw/repository/{项目名}/
```

### 版本控制

```bash
# 日常写作
git add -A
git commit -m "{type}: {简要说明}"
git push origin development

# 完成整体任务
git checkout main
git merge development
git push origin main
git checkout development
```

### 任务调度

```bash
# 派发任务(大管家用)
workboard_create --title "..." --agentId "{agent}"

# 认领任务(子代理用)
workboard_claim --id "{card_id}"

# 完成任务
workboard_complete --id "{card_id}" --summary "..."
```

### 系统维护

```bash
# OpenClaw 服务
openclaw status
openclaw restart

# 记忆系统
openclaw memory status
openclaw memory index --force --agent steward
```

